{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "737c1987-9f97-41b7-b1bd-dfe89491cc40",
    "name": "Clinic API",
    "description": "# Clinic API\n\nBase URL: `{{base_url}}` (environment: Local)\n\n## Authentication\n\n1. `POST /auth/login` returns a token. The Login request saves it automatically.\n    \n2. All other requests send it as `Authorization: Bearer` .\n    \n3. Tokens expire after 8 hours.\n    \n\n## Roles\n\n| Role | Can do |\n| --- | --- |\n| admin | Manage staff and doctor profiles, view dashboard |\n| receptionist | Manage patients and appointments |\n| doctor | Record consultations, view own appointments and patient history |\n\n## Response format\n\nSuccess: `{ success, message, data }`. Errors: `{ success: false, message, errors? }`.\n\n## Status codes\n\n200 OK, 201 Created, 401 not logged in, 403 wrong role or not your record,  \n404 not found, 409 conflict (slot taken, illegal status change),  \n422 validation failed, 429 rate limited.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "48230951",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/48230951-737c1987-9f97-41b7-b1bd-dfe89491cc40?source=collection_link"
  },
